Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.12,0:01:33.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（回波探头）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:39.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（MU/TH/UR 9001苏醒中）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.79,0:01:42.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（2142年2月9日）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:43.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（位置：网罟座泽塔二星系统）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.79,0:01:45.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（任务目标 范围内）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.95,0:02:18.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拦截倒数）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:34.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（威兰企业）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.41,0:02:49.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（目标已取得）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:50.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（返回程序已启动）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:43.66,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\fs18\b1}《异形：罗穆路斯》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体员工注意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention all workers. Attention all workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.25,0:05:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,日班将在15分钟后开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day shift starting in T-minus 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.54,0:05:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,农民立刻至食堂报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farmers to report to mess hall immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果出现任何症状 如发烧 咳嗽\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are experiencing any symptoms, such as fever, cough…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,呕吐或呼吸困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}vomiting, or difficulty breathing…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请至医疗区检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}proceed to the medical bay for examination.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,殖民地安全与福祉是威兰的第一考量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The safety and well-being of our colony is Weyland-Yutani's top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体员工注意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention all workers…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.25,0:05:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说过有幽闭恐惧症的太空人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear about the claustrophobic astronaut?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needed space.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求你别讲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you, you got to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把钱都花在一条不合的皮带上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just spent my full share on a belt that won't fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:05:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好浪「肥」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huge waist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:05:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,玉米面包给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that cornbread.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我「实务」经验丰富\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's 'cause I'm on this seafood diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到食物就吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see food, I eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.20,0:06:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好冷哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.79,0:06:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前听到都会笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always laughed at that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.37,0:06:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我12岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, when I was 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是芬奇先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it's Mr. Finch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天就欠他三个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We owe him three months today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.12,0:06:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会再打来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll call again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时我们可能不在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe we won't be here when he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.75,0:06:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 跟紧一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy. Stay close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,清醒 快清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up. Wake up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是威兰的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all Weyland-Yutani slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,公司供我们吃住 却要我们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The company pays us with food and shelter and takes our lives in exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.37,0:06:51.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（杰克森星采矿殖民地 人口2781）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.95,0:06:53.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（距地球65光年 每年日照时数0）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别相信他们的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't believe their lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们掌控了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They own you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:06:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, Andy. Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Andy. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.91,0:07:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了什么 - 那是诈骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did I do? - It's a scam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,球绝不会在你选的杯子底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ball is never under the cup that you pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是诈术\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要怎么赚钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how am I gonna get the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Money for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到伊瓦加星买马的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}To pay for the horse when we get to Yvaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要买马\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get a horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想叫它雨迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna call it Raindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.33,0:07:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,雨迪 - 我喜欢 很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Raindy. - No, I like it. Yeah, it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去那边等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so you just wait over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能要一下子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I might be a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.75,0:07:34.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（殖民事务处）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别惹麻烦 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay out of trouble, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体员工都将获得照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}All employees will be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请依序排队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Line up in an orderly fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问全名和职业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full name and occupation, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.95,0:07:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽雨恩卡拉定 务农\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie Raines Carradine, ma'am. Farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.37,0:07:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来申请旅行文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about my travel papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:52.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（达到额度：可转移）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我达到额度 应该能离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met my quota, and I should be free to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.66,0:07:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.87,0:07:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.25,0:07:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊瓦加星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yvaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是独立系统 但已完全地球化\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an independent system, but it's fully terraformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里看得见太阳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can actually see the sun out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父母呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.25,0:08:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个周期前去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They died three cycles ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.25,0:08:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为采矿罹患肺病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lung disease, from the mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.91,0:08:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只剩我和我弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just me and my brother now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们贩卖希望 使我们甘愿为奴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sell us hope to keep us slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.87,0:08:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们贩卖希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sell us hope to keep us slaves. Wake up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你还没有资格解约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but you're not eligible for contract release yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.87,0:08:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为缺工 你要被转到矿区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Due to a shortage of workers, you're being transferred to the mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.45,0:08:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 我达到要求时数了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, I reached the required hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须让我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:48.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（殖民工作合约）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.91,0:08:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜额度提高到两万四千小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, quotas have been raised to 24, 000 hours…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.08,0:08:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再过五到六年才能解约\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you'll be released from contract in another five to six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.04,0:08:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 别忘了公司非常感谢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, and remember the company is really grateful…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的持续贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your ongoing service.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:08:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨 - 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rain! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off him! You bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.25,0:09:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 你流血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, you're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.79,0:09:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你重置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm resetting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.41,0:09:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该让你落单的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have left you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.37,0:09:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们贩卖希望 使我们甘愿为奴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sell us hope to keep us slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒吧 你们就是奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up now. They own you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 小雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.37,0:09:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我整天一直打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry. I know I've been calling you all day…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有事情 应该让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, look, something's come up, and I think you should know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.45,0:09:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,到拖车这边来 带上安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, come by the trailers and bring Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.29,0:10:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game over, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.54,0:10:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨 好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sup, Rain? Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说她会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you she'd show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我五块钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me five bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.20,0:10:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.25,0:10:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,盲眼矿工怎么会掉进井里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd the blind miner fall down the well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他有点瞎\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause he couldn't see that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托别怂恿他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't encourage him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去吧 我马上过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, go inside. I'll be there in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯 - 小雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kay. - Rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.70,0:10:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.66,0:11:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我哥也很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know my brother missed you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really glad you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了你们爸爸的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard about your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.54,0:11:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在每个周期的雹暴和新疾病之间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, between the hailstorms and the new diseases every cycle…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.95,0:11:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 大家都快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, everybody's dying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,该给她看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, should we show her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.00,0:11:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚 我们把货放上铁索特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, last night, we're loading up the last Tesotek…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,离地约200哩 突然间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're about 200 miles above the ground, and then all of a sudden…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上收到信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hauler picks up this beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳瓦洛追踪它 结果…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Navarro tracks it, and it turns out…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.29,0:11:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有艘巨型威兰船舰在我们头上漂流\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's this big Wey-Yu ship drifting right above our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.37,0:11:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drifting?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.41,0:11:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,退役 废弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decommissioned. Abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,残骸 大概受损或被淘汰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some old relic. It's probably damaged or obsolete.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.33,0:11:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that guy over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 告诉她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为何要坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we all sitting around here…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待公司永远不会发的旅行许可\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for travel permits that the company are never gonna give to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那艘船有动力带我们去伊瓦加星\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause that hauler has enough power in it to get us to Yvaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:11:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为到伊瓦加星要九年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it takes nine years to get to Yvaga…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有冻眠就到不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can't make that trip without cryo-sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.45,0:12:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,退役船还载着许多可用装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decommissioned ships still carry tons of functional equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,超链接显示那艘船还剩几个冻眠舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the hyperlink shows that ship still has a few pods left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.37,0:12:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想闯入威兰的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to break into a Weyland-Yutani ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷走高度管制装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}and steal highly regulated equipment?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,捷足先登啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before someone else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.45,0:12:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.83,0:12:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 - 才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, of course we are. - No. No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.12,0:12:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是… - 我也这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is… - That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会帮我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 需要我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, what do you need me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要用到安迪 - 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to use Andy. - Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.33,0:12:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是威兰合成人 能跟母亲沟通\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a Weyland-Yutani synthetic. He speaks Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能进入船上的终端机\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can access a terminal on the ship to get us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.70,0:12:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们轻松进出\N{\fnArial\fs30}and out without a fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有那样才能进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们被逮到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but what if we get caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.04,0:12:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,获得旅行许可的机会就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll ruin our chances of ever getting a travel permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 小雨不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Rain's not comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你让我们带安迪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you let us take Andy then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不让我弟自己上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sending my brother up there alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是你弟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not your brother though, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:12:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩 给我闭嘴 - 没错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bjorn, shut the fuck up. - It's true, though, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是你弟 只是威兰的瑕疵品\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not your brother. It's just Wey-Yu damaged goods…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.45,0:13:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸在垃圾里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your dad found in the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.08,0:13:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此而已 认清现实吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's all he is, Rain. So just wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨 - 怎样 我又没说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rain? - What? I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我表弟有时很机车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Listen, I know my cousin can be a dick sometimes, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他说对了一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he is right about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得认清现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家公司什么都不会给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this company, they're not gonna give us anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.20,0:13:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也明白我们只能放手一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that as well as I do. We have to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.41,0:13:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain, I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想落得跟我们爸妈一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to end up like our parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的计划有听起来那么容易吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it as easy as you're making it sound, this plan of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不必离开科布伦号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't even have to get out of the Corbelan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.83,0:13:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点我能保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}That much I can promise you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.66,0:13:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 你愿意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.45,0:14:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩 快 走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn, hurry up, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我要发动了 启动电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm starting her up. Batteries on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.33,0:14:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看氢气引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I get hydro, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.79,0:14:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯控制台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comm panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.79,0:14:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,地面扰流板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ground spoilers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次上太空吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time in space, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.33,0:14:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.62,0:14:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃油汞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuel pump.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,开启 - 两个太空菜鸟来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On. - Two space virgins coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.45,0:14:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好看看窗外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, take a good look outside the window…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.79,0:14:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们不会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause the way I see it, we're never coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.45,0:15:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.45,0:15:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,会很顺利啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还觉得这是好主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure this is a good idea now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.41,0:15:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,强重力来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes the crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:15:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it's done, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.75,0:16:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.16,0:16:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们的太阳\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is our sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.00,0:17:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,人家说伊瓦加星有绝美的夕阳\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say Yvaga has the most incredible sunsets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.83,0:17:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在梦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.25,0:17:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等不及陪你一起看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to see them with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.70,0:17:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说冻眠会让好多年…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I heard that cryo-sleep just makes years…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.79,0:17:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉像狂饮一夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}feel like one night of heavy drinkin' apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等明天在伊瓦加星醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when we wake up in Yvaga tomorrow…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.62,0:17:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会宿醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll wake up with a hangover.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.41,0:17:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.87,0:17:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是船\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.62,0:17:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.83,0:17:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck, that's big. What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.75,0:17:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,退役的前哨站 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decommissioned outpost? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.91,0:18:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是被拖进我们的轨道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably got dragged into our orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳瓦洛 麻烦靠近点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Navarro, let's get closer, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 跟它同步旋转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm gonna match its roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:23.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警告）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险物接近警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hazard proximity alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小行星带比我想的近了一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the beIt's a bit closer than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.37,0:18:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多36小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 36 hours, give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.75,0:18:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.79,0:18:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空站撞上小行星带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the station crashes against the rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.79,0:18:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么 听起来不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you just say? That doesn't sound very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,36小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}36 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.41,0:18:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进出只要30分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be in and out in 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.95,0:18:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.58,0:18:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,顶多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.20,0:18:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定要这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you wanna do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有一项指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have just one directive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.33,0:19:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为小雨的最佳利益着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do what's best for Rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.33,0:19:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad wrote it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.79,0:19:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一堆冷笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That and too many dad jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.91,0:19:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.16,0:19:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那边要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 两分钟后对接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hurry up. We're docking in two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.20,0:19:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要穿这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why I gotta put this on for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.87,0:19:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的蛋蛋才不会冻坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't freeze your balls off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.33,0:19:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再扯到我的蛋蛋 不健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mate, you gotta stop obsessing about my balls, man. It's unhealthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说我就把它们切掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep talking and I'll chop 'em off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是你自己很哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, you really want 'em for yourself, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.45,0:19:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,要看我的蛋蛋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you want me to show you my balls or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.83,0:19:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shut up a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.12,0:19:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿手套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gloves, here, take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.08,0:19:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 别乱碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! No. Stop touching shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 - 比约恩 别烦他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come over here. - Bjorn, leave him alone, for fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.87,0:19:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 别理他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, take no notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他弄坏东西与我无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, okay, won't be my fault when he breaks somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.37,0:20:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面有合成舱门 我要对接了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a synth hatch right ahead. I'm gonna dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.41,0:20:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 慢慢过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. Just bring us in slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.95,0:20:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 里面超冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck me, it's cold in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.33,0:20:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,温度扫描仪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a temp-scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.75,0:20:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,能带我们去找冻眠舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna lead us to the pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,压力够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, compression is good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.75,0:20:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,氧气太稀薄 无法呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxygen is too thin to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.33,0:20:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,换你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.66,0:20:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,该表现一下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your time to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.04,0:21:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.37,0:21:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.25,0:21:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 你破处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congrats. You're not a virgin anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.37,0:21:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.87,0:21:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.58,0:22:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.58,0:22:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该进入零重力状态了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, it looks like we're in zero-g.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.83,0:22:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的肚子感觉得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can feel it in my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.95,0:22:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.12,0:22:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,重力产生器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gravity generators.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.62,0:22:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,离线后仍定时自我清除\N{\fnArial\fs30}When offline, they still purge themselves every few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.41,0:22:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免这里爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prevents the place from blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.29,0:22:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 我肚子又有感觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck me, there goes my stomach again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.37,0:22:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 正前方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.00,0:23:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据扫描仪 冻眠舱应该在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the scanner, the pods should be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.20,0:23:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.62,0:23:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.08,0:23:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.33,0:23:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息 我看到冻眠舱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, great news. I've got eyes on the pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.83,0:23:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.16,0:23:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩 还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.95,0:23:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.70,0:24:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我屁眼裂开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I fractured my asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.37,0:24:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,重力清除不是闹着玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuckin' hell. Don't fuck with this gravity purge, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.79,0:24:16.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（系统启动）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.66,0:24:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好这残骸里还有电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God, there's still some power left in this relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.37,0:24:29.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（氧气复原）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.08,0:24:44.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（重力产生器上线）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.29,0:24:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 重力回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, watch out. Gravity's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.91,0:24:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuckin' hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.91,0:24:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.83,0:24:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这里有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.25,0:25:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.91,0:25:04.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（3.2年）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.95,0:25:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.95,0:25:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.83,0:25:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,冻眠舱燃料不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pods don't have enough fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.33,0:25:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.33,0:25:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们装了停滞三年用的燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're loaded up for three years in stasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.45,0:25:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是到伊瓦加星要九年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but it takes nine years to get to Yvaga, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.29,0:25:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know, I know. I'm aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.54,0:25:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuckin' hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.04,0:25:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. I fuckin' knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.45,0:25:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道 - 别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew it. - Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.62,0:25:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你们应该回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you guys should just come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.87,0:25:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不能放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, we're not givin' up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.25,0:25:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊瓦加星是最近的系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yvaga's the nearest system.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.41,0:25:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are we supposed to do now? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.33,0:25:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we gonna do? - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.50,0:25:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,读数很强 一定是附近的冷冻仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, strong reading. Must be a cryo depot nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.45,0:25:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里应该有更多燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should find more fuel there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.37,0:25:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳瓦洛 我要弹射紧急逃生艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Navarro, I'm ejecting the EEV.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.66,0:25:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.83,0:25:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们接逃生艇 我们找燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys pick it up while we get the cryo-fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.91,0:26:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.16,0:26:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,四百码外 正前方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 400 yards away, dead ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.62,0:26:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛用军人的口令\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the military shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.91,0:26:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 - 你刚说的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - All that military shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.08,0:26:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,效率高 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, it's effective. - Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.70,0:26:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,又很酷 - 才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And cool. - It's not very cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.87,0:26:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来很蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just look like a twat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.87,0:26:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 - 别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - All right, chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.25,0:26:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's keep it movin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.33,0:26:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,再这样我扁你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do that again, I'll fuck you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.50,0:26:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩 别闹了 - 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bjorn, back off! - You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.29,0:26:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他别来惹我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as long as he stays out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.83,0:26:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他干嘛对他这么坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is he being such a dick to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.37,0:26:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为发生在他妈身上的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of what happened to his mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.16,0:26:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.16,0:26:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个周期 矿区瓦斯外泄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last cycle, there was a gas leak in the mines…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.50,0:26:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个合成人决定封闭矿区\N{\fnArial\fs30}so a synthetic made the call to seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.50,0:26:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但比约恩的妈妈还困在里头\N{\fnArial\fs30}them with Bjorn's mom still trapped inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.54,0:26:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.87,0:26:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,合成人不能伤害人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Synthetics can't harm humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.54,0:26:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了救十几个人 牺牲了三名矿工\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sacrificed three miners to save a dozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.75,0:26:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, they can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.45,0:26:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.50,0:27:22.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（紧急逃生艇弹射启动）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.50,0:27:23.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（注意 弹射）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.29,0:27:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.25,0:27:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.16,0:27:45.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（货物舱）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.79,0:27:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.29,0:27:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.62,0:27:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.50,0:28:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay! Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.08,0:28:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.95,0:28:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here. I'm right here. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.00,0:28:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看冻眠舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go check on the pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.79,0:28:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.54,0:28:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没生病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.25,0:28:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.08,0:28:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.83,0:28:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.20,0:28:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子的爸是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the father?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.54,0:28:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.75,0:28:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我哥 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't tell my brother, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.25,0:28:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他烦恼够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He has enough things to worry about. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.79,0:28:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.12,0:28:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴这宝宝能见到太阳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just happy this baby will get to see the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.91,0:29:15.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（威兰企业 打造美好世界）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.70,0:29:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.62,0:29:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 纳瓦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Navarro.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.20,0:29:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,5B气锁室 找到燃料后就从这里出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Airlock 5-B, that's our way out once we find this cryo-fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.04,0:29:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.04,0:29:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎莅临文艺复兴太空站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Renaissance Space Station…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.00,0:29:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,威兰研发中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}the center of Weyland-Yutani Research and Development.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.20,0:29:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,本站分成两部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}The station is divided into two halves…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.54,0:29:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗穆路斯与雷穆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romulus and Remus…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.54,0:29:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,各自致力改善人类在外太空中的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}each dedicated to our quest to improve mankind's role in outer space.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.29,0:29:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里害我起鸡皮疙瘩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place gives me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.41,0:30:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听过有矿工失去左半边吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear about the miner who lost his left side?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.95,0:30:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在是右翼分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.12,0:30:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗 他是右翼分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you get it? He's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.70,0:30:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能关闭自己吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you turn yourself off, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.58,0:30:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were nervous…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.12,0:30:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你… - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I was trying to make sure you were… - Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.08,0:30:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等不及要进冻眠舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I can't wait to get in them pods…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.50,0:30:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也别见到你 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and never see you again, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.37,0:30:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在伊瓦加星会见到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see me in Yvaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.25,0:30:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有要去伊瓦加星\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not going to Yvaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.75,0:30:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.45,0:30:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.70,0:30:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,算你狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.79,0:30:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没告诉你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.95,0:30:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那是非威兰系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, it's a non-Weyland-Yutani system…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.25,0:30:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准有假人\N{\fnArial\fs30}so no fake people allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.66,0:30:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我偏好用「人造人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer the term "artificial person" myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.58,0:30:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.54,0:30:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨带着你可能会坐牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain could end up in prison if she takes you with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.58,0:30:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们待在杰克森星\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you guys stay in Jackson, it's just a matter of time…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.66,0:30:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟早又会被公司停用\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you get decommissioned again by the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.50,0:30:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.54,0:30:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在船上看守冻眠舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you on the ship to guard the pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.29,0:30:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们到那里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But once we get there…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.87,0:30:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,停用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decommish.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.41,0:30:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,永久关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights out for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.12,0:31:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,说完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You done?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.33,0:31:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,实话实说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tellin' the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.20,0:31:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.62,0:31:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对小雨好就是对我好\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's what's best for Rain, it's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.75,0:31:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是好人 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good guy, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.87,0:31:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会想你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.04,0:31:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.54,0:31:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是不忍心告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did not have the heart to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.16,0:31:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.20,0:31:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.20,0:31:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别为了安迪浪费一辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna throw your whole life away for Andy's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.33,0:31:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在乎 那对他不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't care. It doesn't matter to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.70,0:31:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? He's not…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.33,0:31:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, real.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.75,0:32:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,讯号来自这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signal's coming from in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.37,0:32:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说这里停用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you said this place was decommissioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.79,0:32:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.83,0:32:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't look decommissioned to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.83,0:32:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.16,0:32:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但确实遭到弃置\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's definitely deserted.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.45,0:32:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Andy, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.37,0:32:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这个应该能电死合成人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could probably fry a synthetic with one of these…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.25,0:32:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我增强电力\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I just amp up the juices.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.37,0:32:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能带这个走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know, I might take this with me, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.91,0:32:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.91,0:32:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免你有什么怪念头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in case you have any fucking funny ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.16,0:32:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩笑 我开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a joke. I was joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.29,0:32:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞屁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.79,0:33:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.41,0:33:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.58,0:33:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个合成人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only a synthetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.58,0:33:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.54,0:33:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点以为是真人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was a real person there for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.70,0:33:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.29,0:33:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 也许是化学物质外泄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know. A chemical spill, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.25,0:33:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃料一定在那房间 我们拿了就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fuel must be in that room. Let's grab it and get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.25,0:33:37.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（冷冻室）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.54,0:33:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.83,0:33:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩 请拿手电筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn, take the torch please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.16,0:33:58.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（冷冻燃料 危险）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.20,0:34:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这里没有冻眠舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think there's any pods in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.20,0:34:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是冷却设备 用同样的燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, just cooling equipment. Uses the same type of fuel, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.66,0:34:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.58,0:34:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,45公斤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forty-five Ks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.95,0:34:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,到伊瓦加星绰绰有余\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more than enough fuel to get us to Yvaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.95,0:34:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩 麻烦帮我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Bjorn, give me a hand with this, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.75,0:34:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩 数到三往外拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn, pull it out on three, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.66,0:34:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.91,0:34:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.25,0:34:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}three.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.50,0:34:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.79,0:34:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 - 我的手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck. - My fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.66,0:34:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手指没感觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't feel my fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.87,0:34:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痛 我的手冻坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really hurts. Just froze my hands off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.12,0:34:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 - 靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happening? - Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.33,0:34:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 某种紧急封锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know. It's some kind of emergency lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.70,0:34:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.66,0:35:01.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（请联络科学官）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.12,0:35:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有权限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, he doesn't have the clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.37,0:35:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.45,0:35:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有开门的权限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't have the clearance to open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.58,0:35:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说他能重启整艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're trying to tell me that he can fucking reboot the entire ship…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.25,0:35:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不能打开一个普通房间的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}but can't open a random fucking door to a random room?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.33,0:35:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然那不是普通的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, obviously, that's no random room.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.62,0:35:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.20,0:35:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.00,0:35:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我们会救他们出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't worry. We'll get 'em out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.41,0:35:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果安迪打不开 我们应该也没辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Andy can't open those doors, I doubt we'll have better luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.83,0:35:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是威兰合成人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a Weyland-Yutani synthetic…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.16,0:35:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这是非法入侵\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're just trespassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.33,0:35:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 有什么想法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so you got any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.83,0:35:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.62,0:35:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.62,0:36:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.45,0:36:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.00,0:36:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.70,0:36:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.00,0:36:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这个模组还能用\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this module is still working,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.08,0:36:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想传它的凭证给安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can try to transfer its credentials to Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.08,0:36:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,更高的权限应该能开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}A higher clearance should open that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.00,0:36:29.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（标本完成 打印暂停）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.54,0:37:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. It's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.75,0:37:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面好热\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so hot in here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.00,0:37:26.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（X光灯 贴紧身体使用）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.41,0:37:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.20,0:37:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,超赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.37,0:37:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱碰这里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe try not to touch anything in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.87,0:37:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 老妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.33,0:37:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快帮我 帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.79,0:37:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.95,0:37:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,模组 拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The module. Take it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.04,0:37:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.58,0:37:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,太奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was fucked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.04,0:37:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.50,0:37:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.50,0:38:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.20,0:38:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.41,0:38:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.41,0:38:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.70,0:38:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那个合成人身上取出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is from that synthetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.70,0:38:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在安迪的模组上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try putting it on Andy's module.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.70,0:38:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.79,0:38:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.70,0:38:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.33,0:38:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.12,0:38:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.95,0:38:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.12,0:38:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨 我做错了什么 他不动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain, did I do something wrong? He's just frozen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.25,0:38:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在重开机\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just rebooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.70,0:38:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna take a couple of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.50,0:39:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿东西包扎你的手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, let me get you something for those fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.12,0:39:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fuck was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.66,0:39:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那边待一下子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, stay there a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.20,0:39:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.95,0:39:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.70,0:39:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.29,0:39:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了 快起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop playing around, man. Just get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.70,0:39:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 水里有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not playing around. There's something in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.66,0:39:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.66,0:39:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 水里有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I don't know what it is. There's something in the fuckin' water.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.12,0:39:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.41,0:40:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.75,0:40:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.29,0:40:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.58,0:40:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.91,0:40:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩 快想办法救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn, help him! Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.91,0:40:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.58,0:40:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒 - 对不起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tyler! - I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.45,0:40:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.87,0:40:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来帮我 - 不要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! Help me! - No, stop. Stop. Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.95,0:40:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 纳瓦洛 - 那些东西会出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! Navarro! - Those things will get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.66,0:40:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来…如果它们过来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they come in here… If they come in… If they come…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.87,0:40:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.58,0:40:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck. Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.33,0:41:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.08,0:41:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 比约恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Bjorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.25,0:41:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.29,0:41:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bjorn! - Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.45,0:41:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.87,0:41:19.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（获准进入）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.33,0:41:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来 - 快点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of there! - Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.54,0:41:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快… - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, come on, come on! - Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.00,0:41:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.04,0:41:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩 快 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bjorn, come on! - Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.50,0:41:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.91,0:41:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay still. Stay still. - I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.58,0:41:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,它掐住她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's choking her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.25,0:41:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! You gotta stop! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.95,0:41:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它掐住她了 - 可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's choking her! - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.54,0:42:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 比约恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Bjorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.16,0:42:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩 快住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn, stop! For fuck's sake, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.20,0:42:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 - 它要杀死她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop! - What's it doin'? Is it fuckin' killin' her?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.37,0:42:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为那不是它的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not believe that's what the creature is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.08,0:42:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.58,0:42:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.20,0:42:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据那些囊的扩张节奏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on the rhythmic dilatation of those bladders…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.12,0:42:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且与她呼吸模式同步\N{\fnArial\fs30}and its synchronization to her breathing patterns…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.58,0:42:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜它在输氧给她 让她活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd surmise it's feeding her oxygen to keep her alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.79,0:42:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不知道用意何在\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what purpose, I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.33,0:42:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.12,0:42:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是ND255威兰合成人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an ND-255 Weyland-Yutani synthetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.95,0:42:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为执行采矿与安全任务而建造\N{\fnArial\fs30}Originally built for mining and safety tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.29,0:42:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都叫我安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys call me Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.50,0:42:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个模组\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that module.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.58,0:42:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.20,0:42:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,新模组不只升级我的凭证\N{\fnArial\fs30}That new module didn't just upgrade my credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.79,0:42:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还大幅升级我的人工智能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It substantially updated my AI…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.45,0:42:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,此时也在修补我的运动系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's mending my motor systems as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.41,0:42:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,逾期许久的升级\N{\fnArial\fs30}A most overdue upgrade, I must say.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.41,0:42:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要烧死这东西 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit. I'mma fucking fry this thing. - Okay, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.62,0:42:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't! - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.50,0:42:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么强的电流会使它尾屈肌严重收缩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That amount of current will violently contract its tail flexors…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.66,0:42:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄断她的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will break her neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.91,0:42:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有更好的办法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, you got a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.29,0:42:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should we fucking do then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.45,0:43:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 你知道怎么救她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, do you know how to help her?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.25,0:43:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜我的知识库并未改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid my knowledge database has not really changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.00,0:43:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这是什么生物 如何移除它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know what this creature is or how to remove it safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.95,0:43:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现场有人可能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's someone in this room who might.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.04,0:43:44.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（合成人员A2系列）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.16,0:43:45.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（上线：卢克科学官）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.37,0:43:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要守护Z01化合物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to secure Z-01 compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.79,0:43:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是优先任务 其他任务取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mission's priority. All other priorities rescinded.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.79,0:43:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须完成此任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must complete the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.79,0:43:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.16,0:43:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your mission has failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.83,0:43:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.33,0:44:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能告诉我们如何救她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell us what we can do to help her?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.66,0:44:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要救她 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't help her. You run.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.83,0:44:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你们怎么进来 快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out, however you got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.83,0:44:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Wait, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.50,0:44:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会丢下她 你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, we're not fuckin' leavin' her, okay? You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.70,0:44:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就大发慈悲 马上结束她的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then have mercy and end her life now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.41,0:44:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则 你们都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not, you all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.25,0:44:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他究竟在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what the fuck is he sayin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.95,0:44:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在对她做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it doing to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.37,0:44:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只拟寄生物将破胸体植入她体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}The parasitoid is implanting the Plagiarus Praepotens in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.29,0:44:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.62,0:44:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个种子 将与她DNA结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}A seed that will amalgamate with her DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.29,0:44:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,迅速从她体内长出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and rapidly grow out of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.83,0:44:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她体内会长出什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's gonna grow out of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.95,0:44:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,XX121异形\N{\fnArial\fs30}XX121 Xenomorph.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.62,0:44:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,20年前我们拖船首次接触这种标本\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of our towing ships first made contact with this specimen two decades ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.37,0:44:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺史莫号上七名成员 只有一人幸存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the seven crew members aboard the USS Nostromo, only one survived…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.87,0:45:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,将那生物炸出气锁室\N{\fnArial\fs30}blowing the creature out of the airlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.70,0:45:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,此后我们一直在寻找它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been searching for it ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.58,0:45:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,170天前 我们的研究终止\N{\fnArial\fs30}170 days ago, our search came to an end…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.00,0:45:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,异形的身体被带上船\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the body of the Xenomorph was brought on board…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.70,0:45:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,推测已死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}presumed dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.37,0:45:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}But of course…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.83,0:45:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,缺少氧气和食物对这种完美生物…\N{\fnArial\fs30}lack of oxygen and food is of no true consequence to this…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.83,0:45:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,影响不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}perfect organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.41,0:45:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有什么是真正不死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet nothing is truly immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.16,0:45:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,显而易见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.70,0:45:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它大肆破坏这座太空站\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wreaked havoc over this station…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.08,0:45:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们剩下的安全部队射杀它\N{\fnArial\fs30}until what was left of our security forces shot it dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.83,0:45:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,却触发它的告别演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to trigger its swan song.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.45,0:45:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,酸性血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acid for blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.62,0:45:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,硫酸和氢氟酸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulfuric and hydrofluoric.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.50,0:45:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再次封锁太空站 但为时已晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sealed the station back up, but it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.33,0:45:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.66,0:45:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经没人在乎你的船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody cares about your fucking ship anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.41,0:45:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.25,0:45:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果用冷冻燃料冷冻尾巴根部呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we use the cryo-fuel to freeze the root of the tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.16,0:45:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果结冻 它就无法掐住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if it's frozen, it won't choke her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.25,0:45:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.33,0:46:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它拿下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, get it off! Get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.41,0:46:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,它走了 放开你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone. It's off of you. It's off of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.87,0:46:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's off. It's off. It's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.66,0:46:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.37,0:46:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会这么笃定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.33,0:47:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,概率有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the odds?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.37,0:47:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,六成概率对你们朋友不利\N{\fnArial\fs30}60 to 40 against your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.87,0:47:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么概率\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the odds on what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.87,0:47:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只怪物已完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the creature's finished its job already.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.04,0:47:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.16,0:47:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.75,0:47:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类必须经历太多情绪阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans go through too many emotional stages…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.41,0:47:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能接受冷酷但理性\N{\fnArial\fs30}before accepting the cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.50,0:47:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时最艰难的途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet rational - sometimes hardest - path.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.95,0:47:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.87,0:47:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.12,0:47:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.12,0:47:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - I'm sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.29,0:47:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让她回到船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we can't let her back on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.87,0:47:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就麻烦了 - 你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? That is a problem. - What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.79,0:47:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You must understand. - You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.91,0:47:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么怪念头 - 你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's what I mean by "funny ideas"! - What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.29,0:47:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.29,0:47:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不… - 他妈的烂咖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! No! - You fuckin' bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.91,0:47:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Andy! Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.45,0:47:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.45,0:47:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey! I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.75,0:47:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.54,0:47:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒 我们快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler, let's go, man! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.70,0:47:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里 - 比约恩 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm here. - Bjorn! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.70,0:47:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩 不能丢下她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn, we're not leaving without them!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.66,0:47:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里 - 比约恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm here. - Bjorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.00,0:48:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪 - 注意听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are they? - You need to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.79,0:48:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去发动船 - 小雨呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to start the ship, okay? - Where's Rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.87,0:48:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去发动船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go and start the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.91,0:48:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.83,0:48:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直是你的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been nothing but a burden to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.29,0:48:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我终于能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, I can finally help.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.50,0:48:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会再把我当小孩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you won't see me as a child anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.04,0:48:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.83,0:48:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.75,0:48:19.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（基因实验室 冻眠实验室）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.33,0:48:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 - 比约恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Bjorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.16,0:48:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck, fuck, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.16,0:48:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳瓦洛 解除对接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Navarro, undock!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.16,0:48:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让船脱离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undock the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.04,0:48:58.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（解除对接）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undocking initiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.08,0:49:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始解除对接
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.62,0:49:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,气锁室请净空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please clear the airlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.16,0:49:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在干嘛 不能丢下我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is he doing? They can't just leave without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.66,0:49:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得安迪想杀死纳瓦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks Andy's trying to kill Navarro.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.12,0:49:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.45,0:49:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.45,0:49:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.04,0:49:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy? Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.87,0:49:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.54,0:49:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我阻止不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I couldn't stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.41,0:49:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.50,0:49:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.04,0:49:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能丢下我们 回来接我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just leave us here. You gotta come back and get us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.95,0:49:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 她得先关闭那个神经病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I can't do that until she turns that psychopath off.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.66,0:49:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.00,0:50:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.79,0:50:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪失灵了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Andy, he's glitchy. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.62,0:50:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得马上离开这间气锁室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to get away from this airlock right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.20,0:50:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.45,0:50:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳瓦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Navarro?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.45,0:50:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.41,0:50:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.33,0:50:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳瓦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Navarro?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.25,0:50:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.58,0:50:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.45,0:50:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳瓦洛 拜托 纳瓦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Navarro, please. Navarro! Navarro!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.41,0:50:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.50,0:50:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么办 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to do, I'm sorry. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.95,0:50:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.12,0:50:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯 比约恩 纳瓦洛 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay, Bjorn, Navarro, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.66,0:51:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.58,0:51:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊 - 小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! - Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.12,0:51:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么搞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.20,0:51:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托别让我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't let me die.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.87,0:51:16.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警告 燃料）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.04,0:51:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.75,0:52:22.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗穆路斯机库区2号）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.58,0:53:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.04,0:53:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.20,0:53:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.08,0:53:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数47分钟发生撞击\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus-47 minutes to impact event.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.70,0:53:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.87,0:53:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你说有好几小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I thought you said we had hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.75,0:53:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸使太空站的轴线偏移了几度\N{\fnArial\fs30}The explosion pushed the station's axis off by a few degrees…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.16,0:53:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成提早撞击小行星带\N{\fnArial\fs30}just enough to hit the asteroid belt a lot sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.62,0:53:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们撞上哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did they crash?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.58,0:53:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗穆路斯机库区 在太空站另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romulus Hangar Bay, on the other side of the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.95,0:53:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 - 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.79,0:53:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数45分钟发生撞击\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus-45 minutes to impact event.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.50,0:53:47.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（输入存取密码）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.83,0:53:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲 Z01化合物的完整性如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother. What's the integrity of Compound Z-01?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.20,0:53:55.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（储藏完整性）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.62,0:53:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.75,0:54:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得设法到罗穆路斯舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find a way to cross to the Romulus module.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.20,0:54:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.37,0:54:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们一定是从实验室向外扩散\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must've spread from the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.87,0:54:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没别的路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.33,0:54:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, can…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.33,0:54:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脑中听到你的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard your voice in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.08,0:54:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在呼唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.62,0:54:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,ND255人造人\N{\fnArial\fs30}ND-255 artificial person.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.83,0:54:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个型号曾是我们移民行动的支柱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your model was once the backbone of our colonization efforts…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.37,0:54:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸能见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's an honor to be in your presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.33,0:54:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,请容我自我介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.25,0:54:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是卢克科学官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Science Officer Rook…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.45,0:54:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在恳求你提供服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I humbly request your services now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.45,0:54:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我只有一项指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I have just one directive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.25,0:54:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了最佳利益…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do what's best for…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.62,0:55:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你升级后有了新指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your upgrade came with a new directive.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.54,0:55:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会覆盖旧指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}It overrides the old one.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.62,0:55:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.95,0:55:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么要求…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's required of me…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.00,0:55:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.37,0:55:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成我们的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}To finish our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.04,0:55:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 - 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Andy! - Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.33,0:55:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.50,0:55:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.25,0:55:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在为我们的状况请教朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was consulting my friend about our situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.66,0:55:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.16,0:55:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的状况 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Our situation? How do you…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.87,0:55:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy! Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.04,0:55:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些拟寄生物没有眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The parasitoids have no eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.08,0:55:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们靠声音追踪你 但主要靠热信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}They track you by sound, but primarily, by heat signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.75,0:55:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.54,0:55:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的体温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your body temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.83,0:55:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.87,0:55:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果提高室温到与体温相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we raise the temperature in the room to match our bodies…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.16,0:55:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就看不见我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}would that make us invisible to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.37,0:55:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们够安静的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're quiet enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.70,0:56:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个办法能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.87,0:56:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.75,0:56:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.04,0:56:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.58,0:56:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的 我的 大家的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours, mine, and everyone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.54,0:56:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们决定一起行动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all decided to do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.16,0:56:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.37,0:56:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数40分钟发生撞击\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus 40 minutes to impact event.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.25,0:57:01.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危急）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.83,0:57:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,走廊温度目前与你们的体温相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hallway's temperature is now equal to your bodies…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.54,0:57:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些生物应该看不见你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}so the creatures should not be able to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.66,0:57:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但压力 恐惧和恐慌会使体温上升\N{\fnArial\fs30}But stress, fear, panic will spike your temperature…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.37,0:57:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就会曝光\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll be exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.87,0:57:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,汗水 鸡皮疙瘩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweat, goosebumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.79,0:57:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是皮肤试图让身体降温\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your skin trying to cool your body down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.08,0:57:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,请留意那些反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}So watch out for those.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.45,0:57:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持冷静与安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, stay calm and stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.62,1:00:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.95,1:00:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.50,1:00:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.12,1:00:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,比约恩 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bjorn, let's go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.04,1:00:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.29,1:01:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back, stay back, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.50,1:01:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.91,1:01:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.87,1:01:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.54,1:01:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.95,1:01:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.04,1:02:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 泰勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, Tyler…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.66,1:02:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯 我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay, I'm here. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.91,1:02:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒 拜托救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Tyler, help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.20,1:02:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都死了 我门打不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's dead. I can't open this door.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.83,1:02:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.54,1:02:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有红色按键的控制杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lever with the red button…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.33,1:02:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,左边有钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a key to the left.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.66,1:02:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.83,1:02:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.08,1:02:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有钥匙 泰勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a key. There isn't a key, Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.20,1:02:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里 一定在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be there. It has to be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.79,1:02:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}A key. Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.08,1:02:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到钥匙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the key. I have the key.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.70,1:02:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.16,1:03:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.41,1:03:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.95,1:03:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.41,1:03:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.08,1:03:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.66,1:04:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点害他进不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You almost closed the door on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.70,1:04:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但并没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.75,1:04:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我精准计算时间 比上次成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I calculated the timing perfectly with more success than last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.83,1:04:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.00,1:04:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们快接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.70,1:04:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.00,1:04:17.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗穆路斯机库区）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.33,1:04:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数30分钟发生撞击\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus 30 minutes to impact event.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.58,1:04:26.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗穆路斯 雷穆斯）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.00,1:06:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拒绝存取\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access denied.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.66,1:06:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.91,1:07:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里 没事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here. We're here. It's all right, it's all right, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.91,1:07:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.83,1:07:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.00,1:07:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会救你出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.66,1:07:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.00,1:07:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.08,1:07:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.41,1:07:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 小凯 - 安迪 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at me. Kay, Kay, Kay. Look at me. - Andy, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.79,1:07:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯 看着我 我会救你出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay, look at me. Look at me. It's all right. I'm gonna get you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.29,1:07:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 开门 别闹了 - 你干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Andy, open the door. Stop fucking around. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.41,1:07:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.41,1:07:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.45,1:07:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.70,1:07:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上开门 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I need you to open that door right now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.79,1:07:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只怪物就等着我们开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the creature's waiting for us to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.79,1:07:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托快打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.37,1:07:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 开门 - 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Andy. Andy, open the door. - Listen to me. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.08,1:07:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怀孕了 - 拜托 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's pregnant. - Just, please. Guys, please. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.83,1:07:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要生宝宝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna have a baby. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.75,1:07:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.95,1:07:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门两秒 关门又要两秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes that door two seconds to open, another two to fully close.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.12,1:07:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.70,1:07:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 你们在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, what are you doing? Please…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.12,1:07:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样足够让怪物进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's plenty of time for the creature to get in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.45,1:07:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托…快开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, please open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.16,1:07:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么不救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why won't you help me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.45,1:07:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.45,1:07:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托救我 - 你得赶快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, help me, please. - You have to run right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.75,1:07:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 - 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, please. - Run. Run.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.00,1:07:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是队员 - 只能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're one of us, man. You're one of us! - Kay, it's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.25,1:07:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开门 安迪 - 你快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open the fucking door. Andy! - You have to fucking run.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.95,1:07:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗 - 安迪 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right? - Andy, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.33,1:08:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能这样 - 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the only way. - Andy!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.00,1:08:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快跑 - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have to run! - Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.41,1:08:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the fucking…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.70,1:08:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay! Kay!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.62,1:08:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.29,1:08:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.29,1:08:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.25,1:08:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没事 她在动\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's all right. She's moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.70,1:08:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.95,1:08:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 拜托开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, open the door, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.16,1:08:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 我得进去救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, I need to go and get her.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.70,1:08:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.58,1:08:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在没办法救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing I could have done to save her.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.33,1:08:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的可以开门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have opened the fucking door!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.04,1:08:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我们都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd all be dead if I had.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.00,1:08:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得趁怪物进来前离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to move before the creature finds its way into this room.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.62,1:08:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.87,1:08:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的最高指令是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's your prime directive?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.70,1:09:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有了新指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I have a new directive.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.45,1:09:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为公司的最佳利益着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do what's best for the company.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.87,1:09:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得拿掉那个模组\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to remove that module.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.79,1:09:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不符公司的最佳利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid that's not in the best interest of the company.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.25,1:09:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to move.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.25,1:09:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.08,1:09:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.04,1:09:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.79,1:09:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢下人们不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave someone behind?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.00,1:09:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.37,1:09:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成卢克托付给我的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}To finish a task Rook has entrusted upon me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.70,1:09:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成后他会准许科布伦号离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}When completed, he'll clear the Corbelan for departure.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.12,1:09:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开对接区的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}and open the docking bay doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.50,1:09:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能继续前往伊瓦加星\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be free to continue to Yvaga together.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.91,1:09:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回杰克森星\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll return to Jackson.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.91,1:10:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在杰克森星\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stay in Jackson.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.20,1:10:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设我们能活着离开的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, assuming we make it out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.00,1:10:18.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗穆路斯实验室）
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.04,1:10:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.75,1:10:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗穆路斯贝塔实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romulus Beta Lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.41,1:10:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体人员均需A1安全许可\N{\fnArial\fs30}All personnel require A-1 security clearance.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.41,1:10:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.83,1:10:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是某种邪恶的生物武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably some fucked up bio-weapon, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.08,1:11:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实正好相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, quite the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.45,1:11:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, tell them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.29,1:11:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的话告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them what I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.08,1:11:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的殖民地奄奄一息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our colonies are dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.75,1:11:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,极端温度 每个周期都有新疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbearable temperatures, novel diseases every cycle.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.58,1:11:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有毒的矿区烟雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toxic mine fumes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.95,1:11:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,出乎意料的惨况一再发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all one unforeseen tragedy after the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.12,1:11:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类根本不适合太空殖民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mankind was never truly suited for space colonization.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.62,1:11:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们太不堪一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're simply too fragile.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.50,1:11:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们太脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're too weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.29,1:11:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,本站企图改变这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The work of this station aimed to change that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.70,1:11:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类应该是完美生物才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The perfect organism." That's how we should refer to human beings.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.62,1:11:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我纠正这个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I set this wrong right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.33,1:11:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为了人类利用它的天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took its gift for humanity.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.83,1:11:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在异形DNA改造的拟寄生物体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside the parasitoids I bioengineered from the Xenomorph's DNA…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.16,1:11:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了违反牛顿粘性定律的独特液体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I discovered a unique non-Newtonian fluid.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.29,1:11:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.50,1:11:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,最原始纯粹的型态\N{\fnArial\fs30}In its most primal, unadulterated form.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.08,1:11:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种微生物可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This microorganism can be.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.20,1:12:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,已知最具破坏力的病原体\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most destructive pathogen ever observed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.87,1:12:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在实验室经过乙酰化与合成后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But acetylated and synthesized in our lab…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.87,1:12:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将它变成威兰先生梦寐以求的奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've turned it into the miracle Mr. Weyland died searching for.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.66,1:12:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,普罗米修斯之火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prometheus fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.20,1:12:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,给人类的神圣献礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The divine gift to humanity.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.00,1:12:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Z01含有能让异形…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Z-01 contains the genome responsible…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.79,1:12:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,任意加速与减缓代谢的基因组\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the Xeno's ability to accelerate and slow down its metabolism at will.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.45,1:12:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的共生能力可透过血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its symbiotic capableness easily rewrites.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.66,1:12:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻易改写宿主的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}the host's DNA through its blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.04,1:12:31.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（自动注射器）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.50,1:12:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是人类亟需且迟来的升级\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a much needed and well overdue upgrade for humanity.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.29,1:12:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再也不能等待演化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We simply cannot wait for evolution anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.91,1:12:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能离开了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, can we get out of here now?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.66,1:12:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的任务是带这个回殖民地继续发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mission is to take this back to the colony for further development.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.45,1:12:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克在追踪化合物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rook is tracking the compound.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.87,1:12:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在船上侦测到后 他就会打开对接区\N{\fnArial\fs30}When detected inside our ship, he'll open the docking bay doors…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.45,1:12:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定货船为自动驾驶 回殖民地\N{\fnArial\fs30}and set the hauler on autopilot back to the colony.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.91,1:12:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.54,1:12:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.41,1:13:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.00,1:13:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意在猎杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fucking thing's huntin' us.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.95,1:13:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 新计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. New plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.00,1:13:11.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（开启）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.70,1:13:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有办法用枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you manage yourself with a gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.79,1:13:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I fucking can.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.66,1:13:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是F44AA脉冲步枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, this is an F44AA pulse rifle.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.12,1:13:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,转动式闭锁 电磁脉冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's rotating breech, electronic pulse action.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.08,1:13:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是殖民地陆战队用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what the Colonial Marines used.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.54,1:13:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,AA代表瞄准辅助\N{\fnArial\fs30}AA stands for Aiming Assist.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.37,1:13:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 放在手臂下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, right, you put that under your arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.20,1:13:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这只手放这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Right, this hand here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.95,1:13:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Aim it towards Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.79,1:13:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,扳机扣一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull the trigger halfway.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.12,1:13:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 上了保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, the safety's on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.12,1:13:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.50,1:13:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准辅助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aiming assistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.20,1:13:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那玩意过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that thing comes towards you…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.54,1:13:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对准它的方向就不会失手\N{\fnArial\fs30}you point it in its general direction, you'll never miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.29,1:13:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you learn all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.45,1:14:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏和杂志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Games and magazines.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.66,1:14:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有一个弹匣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've just got one mag. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.00,1:14:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,450发\N{\fnArial\fs30}450 rounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.66,1:14:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一枪都不能发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you mustn't fire a single one.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.95,1:14:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,酸性血液 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acid for blood. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.50,1:14:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在太空站底层\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the bottom floor of the station.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.50,1:14:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚下是太空真空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Below our feet is the vacuum of space.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.29,1:14:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,射杀那只怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoot that creature…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.75,1:14:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证立刻失压\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's a guaranteed instant decompression.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.66,1:14:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we all die.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.87,1:14:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那给我们枪干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the point in giving us the guns?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.41,1:14:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物可能把它当成威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the creature may see it as a threat…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.41,1:14:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许不会正面攻击我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe won't charge at us dead on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.33,1:14:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.66,1:14:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,概率很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.95,1:14:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现一条输送带通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found us a way through the conveyor belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.29,1:14:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.00,1:14:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.79,1:14:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.54,1:15:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数20分钟发生撞击\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus 20 minutes to impact event.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.12,1:15:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走廊底有电梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lift at the end of this corridor.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.16,1:15:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,能直接送我们到船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will take us directly to our ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.91,1:15:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些东西还有更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more of those things.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.62,1:15:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.62,1:15:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们似乎在这里一段时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They seem to have been here for quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.41,1:16:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.95,1:16:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.66,1:16:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙碌的小怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Busy little creatures.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.91,1:16:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好回头找别的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we better go back and find another way.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.33,1:16:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That might be a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.41,1:16:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 看能否打开这道门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, see if you can open this gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.66,1:16:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.54,1:16:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.16,1:17:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.50,1:17:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.25,1:17:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.54,1:17:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.62,1:17:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.41,1:17:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.54,1:17:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.62,1:17:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.62,1:17:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got her, I got her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.08,1:17:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我们救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. We got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.04,1:17:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.08,1:18:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们救你下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we got you, we got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.54,1:18:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.50,1:18:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.95,1:18:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.12,1:18:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒 她流了很多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler, she's losing a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.79,1:18:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这样才没被植入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's why she hasn't been implanted yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.91,1:18:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.16,1:18:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她脚边没有死掉的拟寄生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no dead parasitoid by her feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.87,1:18:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 这要怪你 你想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, this is on you. So you do something.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.66,1:18:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Andy!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.16,1:18:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类25%的基因组与老鼠相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}25% of the human genome is shared with rats.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.50,1:18:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它对老鼠有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it worked on the rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.75,1:18:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.12,1:18:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.41,1:18:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有什么选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}What choice do I have?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.50,1:18:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带她回货船 放进冻眠舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take her back to the hauler and we put her in the cryo-pod. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.70,1:18:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持她的生命 回殖民地接受治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will keep her alive long enough to get her proper treatment back at the colony.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.08,1:18:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.79,1:18:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 她撑得住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, will she make it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.12,1:18:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果动作快的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.91,1:19:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.29,1:19:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了 - 这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I see it. I see it. - This is it, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.87,1:19:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扶她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got her. I got her. I got her.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.37,1:19:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.16,1:19:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好惊险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're so close. We're so close.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.66,1:19:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.33,1:19:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快到了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're almost there. We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.87,1:19:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就差一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, you're so close.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.95,1:19:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要撑下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gotta hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.62,1:19:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.50,1:19:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.12,1:19:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.12,1:20:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有这点能耐 只有这招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all you got? Is that all you got?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.75,1:20:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.75,1:20:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 泰勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Tyler!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.12,1:21:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay, Kay, listen to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.45,1:21:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯直通我们的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}This goes straight to our ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.45,1:22:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你注射这个 进入冻眠舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to take this. And get into a cryo-pod.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.79,1:22:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动驾驶会载你回殖民地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And autopilot will fly you back to our colony.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.45,1:22:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.04,1:22:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.20,1:22:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.79,1:22:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想办法回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find a way back.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.04,1:22:29.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（上）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.16,1:24:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.54,1:24:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你修好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll fix you in return.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.66,1:24:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.70,1:24:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll die in here…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.70,1:24:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不符公司或我的最佳利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's not in the best interest of the company or mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.66,1:25:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 安迪 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Andy, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.16,1:25:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数10分钟发生撞击\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus 10 minutes to impact event.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.50,1:25:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.12,1:25:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.91,1:25:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so, so sorry. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.41,1:25:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我才抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.66,1:25:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖延它们不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't hold them off for long.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.04,1:26:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.95,1:26:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.33,1:26:17.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗穆路斯实验室）
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.41,1:26:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…拜托帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey. Please help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.58,1:26:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.16,1:26:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得驳回你的请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I must deny your petition.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.41,1:26:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能冒险危及Z01化合物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't risk compromising the compound.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.00,1:26:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我很感激两位给予公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}But know that I'm grateful for the invaluable help…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.41,1:26:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,无价的协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}you two have provided to the company.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.41,1:26:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.75,1:26:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.91,1:26:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 - 打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - Open.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.79,1:26:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.95,1:26:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.54,1:26:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能骗你们概率有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't lie about your chances…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.12,1:26:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我同情你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have my sympathies.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.91,1:27:16.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（远端）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.37,1:27:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,按下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Press it…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.91,1:27:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才能控制你的船 带你飞离\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can take control of your ship and fly you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.33,1:27:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.62,1:27:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.70,1:27:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的同伴死了 好让你存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your companions died so you could live.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.66,1:27:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,按下按键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Press the button…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.50,1:27:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我确保他们不会白白牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let me honor their sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.50,1:27:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 你能说个笑话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, can you tell me one of your jokes?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.33,1:27:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物为什么不吃小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't monsters eat clowns?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.95,1:27:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝起来很好笑 - 尝起来很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 'Cause they taste funny. - They taste funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.50,1:27:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞不懂复制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand cloning at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.54,1:27:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.16,1:28:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过一本讲零重力的好书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read a great book about zero gravity.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.12,1:28:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放不下来 - 放不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just couldn't put it down. - Couldn't put it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.29,1:28:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.91,1:28:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.91,1:28:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨 你要干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.83,1:28:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要关闭重力产生器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm turning off the gravity generator.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.00,1:28:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,十…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.08,1:28:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,九 八 七\N{\fnArial\fs30}nine, eight, seven…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.33,1:28:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,六 五\N{\fnArial\fs30}six, five…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.54,1:28:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,四 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}four, three…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.70,1:28:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}two, one.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.41,1:28:29.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（关）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.29,1:28:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨 你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain, are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.87,1:28:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个办法能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.04,1:28:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It works.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.95,1:29:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.95,1:29:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有40%\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're at 40%.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.29,1:29:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,20%\N{\fnArial\fs30}20%.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.79,1:29:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.62,1:29:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.91,1:29:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在我后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.95,1:30:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.62,1:30:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.83,1:30:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.37,1:30:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得到电梯那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get to the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.29,1:31:00.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（下次重力清除 系统倒数）
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.45,1:31:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯没重力就无法运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The elevator won't work without gravity.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.75,1:31:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.83,1:31:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.91,1:31:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.54,1:32:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.62,1:32:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是重力清除\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a gravity purge!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.75,1:32:29.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（开）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.50,1:32:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.87,1:32:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.37,1:33:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.45,1:34:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,离她远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from her.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.33,1:34:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.75,1:34:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞击倒数十…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impact event in 10…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.83,1:35:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,九 八\N{\fnArial\fs30}nine, eight…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.25,1:35:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,七 六\N{\fnArial\fs30}seven, six…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.91,1:35:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,五\N{\fnArial\fs30}five…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.25,1:35:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,四 三 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- four, three… - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.75,1:35:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}…two, one.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.45,1:35:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.20,1:35:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.83,1:35:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.45,1:35:26.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（MU/TH/UR要求远端接管）
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.33,1:35:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你们俩活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad to see you two made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.62,1:35:34.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（MU/TH/UR接管）
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.04,1:36:24.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（冻眠舱超眠系统）
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.70,1:36:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you. Watch your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.91,1:36:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 - 你们没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - You're gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.12,1:36:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,母子都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.95,1:36:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,公司对今天的成就感到无比骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The company couldn't be prouder of what's been accomplished here today.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.16,1:36:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已传信息回总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've sent a message back to HQ.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.25,1:36:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,半年后收到后 他们会前往杰克森星\N{\fnArial\fs30}When received in six months, they'll travel to Jackson's Star…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.75,1:36:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,接收Z01化合物 做进一步研发\N{\fnArial\fs30}to retrieve the compound from you for further development.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.66,1:36:56.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（手动驾驶 自动驾驶）
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.50,1:37:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.75,1:37:02.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（MU/TH/UR断线）
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.87,1:37:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.50,1:37:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, stop her.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.95,1:37:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻重新连线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reconnect us now.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.20,1:37:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…你们不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You two cannot do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.08,1:37:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Z01化合物必须交给公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}The compound must be delivered to the company.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.33,1:37:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须驳回你的请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I must deny your petition.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.70,1:37:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你今天愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.79,1:37:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个最好听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you better listen to me here, now, you two.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.29,1:37:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在大计划下微不足道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are insignificant in the great scheme of things. You…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.41,1:37:28.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（清除）
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.12,1:37:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.41,1:37:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让你系统保持连线 直到伊瓦加星\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will keep your systems online until we get to Yvaga.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.16,1:37:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为… - 我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I thought that… - I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.50,1:37:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我走 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming with me. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.66,1:38:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要符合小雨的最佳利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's what's best for Rain.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.95,1:38:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 我给你一项新指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, I have a new directive for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.83,1:38:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我们的最佳利益着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what's best for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.04,1:38:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.41,1:38:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.66,1:38:36.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（生命征象危急 停滞中断）
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.62,1:38:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.08,1:38:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Kay. Kay.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.08,1:38:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.79,1:38:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,惨了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.91,1:39:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它抓走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it away from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.00,1:40:11.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（货物完整性受损）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.00,1:40:13.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（自动驾驶断线）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.50,1:40:14.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（手动驾驶）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.83,1:40:39.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（货斗开启 离线）
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.58,1:41:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.83,1:43:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.33,1:43:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Please, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.54,1:43:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy! Andy!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.16,1:43:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.75,1:43:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雨…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain. Rain.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.16,1:43:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help her.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.33,1:44:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.91,1:44:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.62,1:44:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.79,1:45:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.62,1:45:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.66,1:45:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.00,1:45:25.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（室温危急）
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.54,1:46:19.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（货斗开启 上线 拉控制杆启动）
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.20,1:46:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,手动解开货物 拉四根控制杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Manual Cargo Release. Pull the four levers."
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.33,1:46:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 四根控制杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yes. The four levers. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.62,1:46:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.41,1:46:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.37,1:47:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.41,1:47:42.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拉所有控制杆以解开）
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.08,1:47:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬升…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up. Pull up.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.70,1:49:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 妈的贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.41,1:50:13.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（手动 自动驾驶）
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.12,1:50:31.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（自动驾驶目的地：伊瓦加三号星）
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.75,1:50:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会修好你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fix you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.12,1:51:09.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（人体冷冻声音日志）
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.20,1:51:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是采矿货船科布伦号的冷冻日志\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the cryo-log for the mining hauler Corbelan.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.95,1:51:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们前往伊瓦加星系 不知能否到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I set course to the Yvaga system without knowing if I'll ever reach it…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.20,1:51:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或面临什么命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}or what fate is to find me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.33,1:51:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 我都会面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whatever comes, I'll face it.
